For all those of you who are interested in the spoiler file (especially the
four or so who have mailed me since my last post :-), here's the latest
scoop:

Earlier today (er... yesterday, I guess, since it's past midnight now) I
mailed of revision 3.97 of the Wheaton College Nethack Spoiler File to
Bill Randle, the moderator of comp.sources.games.  This version of the
spoiler sheet should be appearing within about a week on comp.sources.games,
so be on the lookout for it there.  Once it has been posted there, it will
be automatically archived at several sites, and we will be posting 
information about sites that you can FTP it from, UUCP it from, or e-mail
server it from here on rec.games.hack.

Note:  We will no longer be servicing requests for copies of the spoiler
file.  All requests should be made to the various sites which we will make
known here instead.  Until then, be patient - it shouldn't take too long!

Now, here's some information about what's changed:  For starters, the
diffs from revision 2.00 to revision 3.97 are over 70K.  Revision 3.97
is approximately 150K, so get your disk quota ready!  We have corrected 
many minor errors, answered several questions posted on rec.games.hack
since revision 2.00 was posted, and either totally revised or added 
many new sections.  These revised or added sections are:  Castle Level,
Special Levels, Special Rooms, Identifying Amulets, Identifying Armor,
Potion Quaffing Effects, Potion Throwing Effects, Potion Vapor Effects,
Identifying Potions, Identifying Rings, Scroll Effects, Confused Scroll
Effects, Identifying Scrolls, Identifying Tools, and Identifying Wands.

Please realize that this revision of the spoilers is an intermediary
release.  We are still adding many new sections and revising many of
the currently existing sections.  When we are completely finished making
all the revisions/additions we currently have planned, we will post it
to comp.sources.games again, as well as to rec.games.hack, and then 
we'll be free to start adding and revising all over again. :-)

